abstract: >-
  Interactive web dashboard demonstrating synthetic SCADA-based leak monitoring
  with in-browser logistic regression, rule-based detection, geospatial
  visualization, and operator incident workflow. Fictional city setting;
  educational use only; not affiliated with any water utility.
